---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="What Goods Desk collects, and what it does not.">
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:3rem">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-08-06">August 6, 2026</time></p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      We do not ask you to create an account, and we do not collect names, addresses or payment
      details. If you email us, we keep that email so we can reply to it.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use privacy-focused analytics to count page views and see which articles are read. This
      records aggregate information such as page URL, referring site, approximate country, and
      device type. It does not build a profile of you across other websites.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links and cookies</h2>
    <p>
      When you click an affiliate link, the retailer — for example Amazon — may set a cookie in
      your browser so it can attribute a resulting purchase to this site. That cookie is set by
      the retailer under its own privacy policy, not by us, and we never see your order details,
      payment information, or identity. We only see aggregate totals of clicks and sales.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can block or delete these cookies in your browser settings at any time. Doing so does
      not change the price you pay or your ability to use this site.
    </p>

    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>
      This site is hosted by a third-party hosting provider, which processes standard server
      logs, including IP addresses, for security and reliability purposes. We do not sell or
      share personal information with advertisers or data brokers.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live, you may have the right to request access to, correction of, or
      deletion of personal information we hold about you. Because we hold almost none, this
      usually means email correspondence. Write to
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> and we will respond.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is intended for adults and is not directed at children under 13. We do not
      knowingly collect information from children.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes, we will update the date at the top of this page.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
